Chest (ResultChest3D):
- Camera 3/4 top-down: pitch 36°, from the front-right (azimuth 38°), fov 36, distance 5.6. Look-at y 0.68 for both
  states instead of the SPEC's 0.42 / 0.55: at 0.55 the lid's bounding box leaves the frame mid-sweep (−93°).
- Per-chest material: albedoScale (1.10, 1.06, 1.00), roughness 0.6, specularIntensity 0.35.
- Lights: key near-overhead top-left #FFEDCC ×4 (a far sphere light, so the island's directional light is untouched),
  fill low front-right #CCE0FF ×0.4, new rim behind/above #FFD18C ×1.1, InnerGlow #FFCC6B ×1.4 r2.2 once open.
- Outline ≈ 1.5 pt #4A2810 by silhouette expansion: 8 offset, tinted copies of the render behind it (no inverted hull).
- 2D contact shadow under the 3D chest: #3C2614 α45% day / 30% night, offset right/back, feathered.
- 2D fallback = chest/chest_v3_0 / chest_v3_12, scaled to 400 wide, 256-colour PNG (outline + shadow baked in).
- Chest shown 8 right of centre (SPEC); frame calibration CHEST_FRAME 0.60 / 0.028, LID_REACH 0.47.
Text (SPEC v2.2 list): no step line, no 点宝箱领取, no reward names, no unlock hint (成绩已保存 was already gone;
a failed save still shows 重试保存). Rewards are icons only; CountBadge (Ø24 #E88034, 14pt white) for count > 1
(ResultReward.count; the hosts don't pass counts yet).
Tests: style/safe_area expect only the four texts; CountBadge check; chest_3d checks camera, framing over the whole
lid sweep, lights, material and outline.
